    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present this charming 4-bedroom, 1-bathroom semi-detached home, complete with an extension to the side, side access and ideally located on the highly sought-after Larkhill Road in Whitehall.\r\n\r\nProperty description:\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented four-bedroom home has undergone extensive renovation and upgrading in recent years, creating a comfortable, energy-efficient and move-in-ready property, reflected in its impressive B-rated BER. The comprehensive works include upgraded windows and doors, internal insulation, new electrical and plumbing systems, and new flooring throughout. The result is a substantially modernised home offering generous accommodation, improved energy efficiency and the benefit of significant upgrades already completed.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area. The kitchen is finished to a modern standard with fitted appliances and direct access to the rear garden. Also on this level is a comfortable sitting room to the front, a convenient utility room providing additional laundry and storage space, and a generously sized double bedroom which offers excellent flexibility and could easily be used as a home office, playroom or guest room, depending on the needs of the new owners.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms along with a modern family bathroom complete with a walk-in shower.\r\n\r\nThe upgrades carried out in recent years are evident throughout the home, creating a fresh, contemporary feel while offering the benefit of a property that is ready for its new owners to move straight into. Externally, the front driveway provides off-street parking, while a side passage gives access to the rear garden. Designed with low maintenance in mind, the rear garden features concrete paving and artificial grass, together with a decking area ideal for relaxing, entertaining and outdoor dining.\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\n\r\nLarkhill Road is ideally situated within walking distance of local shops, schools and cafés. The area is well served by public transport and offers easy access to the M1 and M50 motorways, providing convenient connections to Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre. This property is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or anyone seeking a spacious, low-maintenance home in a convenient and well-connected location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall – 3'.7\" x 9'.1\"\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway with laminate wood flooring and carpeted stairs leading to the first floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 9'.7\" x 9'.1\"\r\nBright open-plan living space with laminate wood flooring, spotlights and fitted Venetian blinds.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Area – 15'.6\" x 15'.4\"\r\nImpressive open-plan, rear-extended kitchen and dining area with laminate wood flooring and spotlights. The modern fitted kitchen provides ample wall and floor-mounted storage, complemented by a central kitchen island with additional drawer storage and workspace. Integrated appliances include an oven, microwave, electric hob, extractor fan, fridge freezer and dishwasher. Double-glazed windows overlook the rear garden, with a fitted roller blind and wall-mounted vertical radiator.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bedroom – 8'.2\" x 12'.4\"\r\nGenerously sized and versatile room with laminate wood flooring, recessed spotlights and a double-glazed window with fitted Venetian blinds. Ideal for use as a fourth bedroom, home office, playroom or guest room.\r\n\r\nUtility / Laundry Room – 5.7' x 7.9\"\r\nPractical utility space with laminate wood flooring, fitted wall-mounted storage, plumbing for a washing machine and housing for the boiler.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom – 8'.2\" x 13'.6\"\r\nWell-proportioned double bedroom with laminate wood flooring and a double-glazed window with fitted Venetian blinds.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom – 15'.6\" x 10'.5\"\r\nSpacious primary bedroom with laminate wood flooring and fitted roller blind.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom – 10'.5\" x 6'.5\"\r\nGenerously sized and fully tiled bathroom featuring both a walk-in shower and separate bathtub, W.C., W.H.B., fitted roller blind and wall-mounted vertical radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom – 10'.5\" x 9'.6\"\r\nGenerously proportioned double bedroom with ample space to accommodate a king-size bed, finished with laminate wood flooring and a double-glazed window with fitted Venetian blinds."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Extensively renovated four-bedroom home with side extension\r\n\r\nNew electrical system, New plumbing, New flooring\r\n\r\nImpressive B-rated BER with Internal insulation \r\n\r\nBright and spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area\r\n\r\nGround-floor double bedroom\r\n\r\nGas-fired central heating \r\n\r\nSeparate utility room of the kitchen\r\n\r\nOff street parking to the front\r\n\r\nConvenient side access to rear garden\r\n\r\nExcellent transport links to Dublin City Centre and Airport\r\n\r\nWithin easy reach of Dublin City University (DCU)\r\n\r\nEasy access to the M1 and M50 and excellent transport links\r\n\r\nClose to a host of amenities"
